    (3, 1, 'A blue bus stopped near the park. Three friends climbed aboard with their bags.'),
    (4, 1, 'The baker opened his shop early. Fresh rolls filled the room with a warm smell.'),
    (5, 1, 'Rain tapped softly on the roof. Nila closed her book and watched the street.'),
    (6, 1, 'A dog slept under the old bench. Its ears moved when the children walked past.'),
    (7, 1, 'The train crossed a green field. From the window, Ravi saw a line of trees.'),
    (8, 1, 'Two lamps lit the quiet room. Sara found her pencil and began a new drawing.'),
    (9, 1, 'The shop sold red apples and yellow pears. Each basket had a neat paper sign.'),
