    (18, 1, 'A gentle wind moved the tall grass. The path to the river was easy to follow.'),
    (19, 1, 'The team shared a large map. They found the bridge and marked a safe route.'),
    (20, 1, 'At dusk, the street lights came on. Families walked home after the fair.'),
    (21, 2, 'The museum guide lifted a small wooden box, then asked visitors to guess what it once held.'),
